  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\sin x+\\sin ^2 x=1, x \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$, then $\\left(\\cos ^{12} x+\\tan ^{12} x\\right)+3\\left(\\cos ^{10} x+\\tan ^{10} x+\\cos ^8 x+\\tan ^8 x\\right)+\\left(\\cos ^6 x+\\tan ^6 x\\right)$ is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QzA8q",
      "text": "4",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
